2026-07-27T07:06:56.2329222Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2394315Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2395058Z i /tmp/RtmpzRuvFG/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2395567Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2396421Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2397424Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2398313Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2399539Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2400474Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2642458Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:06:56.2751125Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:06:56.3187023Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:06:56.3355356Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
